<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher Wednesday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 566.06, up 0.83.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 270 to 259.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,099,600, compared with 19,144,270 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
